      "content": "rest? i dont think i can rest. everything is just so empty. it feels like if i keep trying to find a \"new direction,\" i'm just dragging this weight around for no reason. the fog is so thick i cant even see my own hands. it feels more like a conclusion than a pause. like the story is just... done.",
